      "prompt": "When collaborating with designers on our forecasting UI, how do you communicate the technical trade-offs of implementing custom data visualizations while ensuring the final product aligns with their aesthetic vision for our grocery chain clients?",
      "answer_outline": "The candidate should describe a collaborative approach, such as involving designers early in the feasibility phase. They should explain how they use prototypes or data examples to show why certain designs might be difficult to implement and how they propose compromises that maintain the design intent.",
      "difficulty": 2
    },
